    "name":  "LED Strip 220V | 120 LED/m | 50m | SMD2835 | 800Lm/M | 8W/M | IP65 | Cut every 10cm",
    "reference":  "SP120D8W-CW-92142",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e220V LED Strip with 120 LEDs/m SMD2835\u003c/strong\u003e and power of \u003cstrong\u003e8W/m\u003c/strong\u003e in a \u003cstrong\u003e50-meter\u003c/strong\u003e reel is the ideal solution for outdoor lighting projects. With 10mm width and \u003cstrong\u003ecuts every 10cm,\u003c/strong\u003e it offers flexibility and ease of installation. \u003cstrong\u003eNo power supply or rectifier bridge required\u003c/strong\u003e. With IP65 protection, perfect for illuminating any space, both outdoor and indoor.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Strip 220V | 120 LED/m | 50m | SMD2835 | 800Lm/M | 8W/M | IP65 | Cut every 10cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED Strip 220V SMD2835. 120 LED/m, 8W/m, 800Lm/m. \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e for outdoor protected areas. Cut every 10cm. 50m roll without transformer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Decorative lighting, facades, gardens, hallways.\u003c/h3\u003e",
